{"version":2,"surah":78,"verses":[{"n":1,"key":"78:1","arabic":" عَمَّ يَتَسَآءَلُونَ","page":582,"juz":30,"en":"About what are they asking one another?","id":"Tentang apakah mereka saling bertanya-tanya?","latinEn":"AAamma yatasaaloon","latinId":"‘Amma yatasā'alūn(a).","words":[{"a":"عَمَّ","en":"About what","id":"About what","t":"ʿamma"},{"a":"يَتَسَآءَلُونَ","en":"are they asking one another","id":"are they asking one another","t":"yatasāalūna"}]},{"n":2,"key":"78:2","arabic":"عَنِ ٱلنَّبَإِ ٱلْعَظِيمِ","page":582,"juz":30,"en":"About the great news -","id":"Tentang berita yang besar (hari berbangkit),","latinEn":"AAani annaba-i alAAatheem","latinId":"‘Anin naba'il-‘aẓīm(i).","words":[{"a":"عَنِ","en":"About","id":"About","t":"ʿani"},{"a":"ٱلنَّبَإِ","en":"the News","id":"the News","t":"l-naba-i"},{"a":"ٱلْعَظِيمِ","en":"the Great","id":"the Great","t":"l-ʿaẓīmi"}]},{"n":3,"key":"78:3","arabic":"ٱلَّذِى هُمْ فِيهِ مُخْتَلِفُونَ","page":582,"juz":30,"en":"That over which they are in disagreement.","id":"yang dalam hal itu mereka berselisih.","latinEn":"Allathee hum feehi mukhtalifoon","latinId":"Allażī hum fīhi mukhtalifūn(a).","words":[{"a":"ٱلَّذِى","en":"(About) which","id":"(About) which","t":"alladhī"},{"a":"هُمْ","en":"they","id":"they","t":"hum"},{"a":"فِيهِ","en":"(are) concerning it","id":"(are) concerning it","t":"fīhi"},{"a":"مُخْتَلِفُونَ","en":"(in) disagreement","id":"(in) disagreement","t":"mukh'talifūna"}]},{"n":4,"key":"78:4","arabic":"كَلَّا سَيَعْلَمُونَ","page":582,"juz":30,"en":"No! They are going to know.","id":"Tidak! Kelak mereka akan mengetahui,","latinEn":"Kalla sayaAAlamoon","latinId":"Kallā saya‘lamūn(a).","words":[{"a":"كَلَّا","en":"Nay","id":"Nay","t":"kallā"},{"a":"سَيَعْلَمُونَ","en":"(soon) they will know","id":"(soon) they will know","t":"sayaʿlamūna"}]},{"n":5,"key":"78:5","arabic":"ثُمَّ كَلَّا سَيَعْلَمُونَ","page":582,"juz":30,"en":"Then, no! They are going to know.","id":"sekali lagi tidak! Kelak mereka akan mengetahui.","latinEn":"Thumma kalla sayaAAlamoon","latinId":"Ṡumma kallā saya‘lamūn(a).","words":[{"a":"ثُمَّ","en":"Then","id":"Then","t":"thumma"},{"a":"كَلَّا","en":"Nay","id":"Nay","t":"kallā"},{"a":"سَيَعْلَمُونَ","en":"(soon) they will know","id":"(soon) they will know","t":"sayaʿlamūna"}]},{"n":6,"key":"78:6","arabic":"أَلَمْ نَجْعَلِ ٱلْأَرْضَ مِهَـٰدًا","page":582,"juz":30,"en":"Have We not made the earth a resting place?","id":"Bukankah Kami telah menjadikan bumi sebagai hamparan,","latinEn":"Alam najAAali al-arda mihada","latinId":"Alam naj‘alil-arḍa mihādā(n).","words":[{"a":"أَلَمْ","en":"Have not","id":"Have not","t":"alam"},{"a":"نَجْعَلِ","en":"We made","id":"We made","t":"najʿali"},{"a":"ٱلْأَرْضَ","en":"the earth","id":"the earth","t":"l-arḍa"},{"a":"مِهَـٰدًۭا","en":"a resting place","id":"a resting place","t":"mihādan"}]},{"n":7,"key":"78:7","arabic":"وَٱلْجِبَالَ أَوْتَادًا","page":582,"juz":30,"en":"And the mountains as stakes?","id":"dan gunung-gunung sebagai pasak?","latinEn":"Waljibala awtada","latinId":"Wal-jibāla autādā(n).","words":[{"a":"وَٱلْجِبَالَ","en":"And the mountains","id":"And the mountains","t":"wal-jibāla"},{"a":"أَوْتَادًۭا","en":"(as) pegs","id":"(as) pegs","t":"awtādan"}]},{"n":8,"key":"78:8","arabic":"وَخَلَقْنَـٰكُمْ أَزْوَٰجًا","page":582,"juz":30,"en":"And We created you in pairs.","id":"Dan Kami menciptakan kamu berpasang-pasangan,","latinEn":"Wakhalaqnakum azwaja","latinId":"Wa khalaqnākum azwājā(n).","words":[{"a":"وَخَلَقْنَـٰكُمْ","en":"And We created you","id":"And We created you","t":"wakhalaqnākum"},{"a":"أَزْوَٰجًۭا","en":"(in) pairs","id":"(in) pairs","t":"azwājan"}]},{"n":9,"key":"78:9","arabic":"وَجَعَلْنَا نَوْمَكُمْ سُبَاتًا","page":582,"juz":30,"en":"And made your sleep [a means for] rest","id":"dan Kami menjadikan tidurmu untuk istirahat,","latinEn":"WajaAAalna nawmakum subata","latinId":"Wa ja‘alnā naumakum subātā(n).","words":[{"a":"وَجَعَلْنَا","en":"And We made","id":"And We made","t":"wajaʿalnā"},{"a":"نَوْمَكُمْ","en":"your sleep","id":"your sleep","t":"nawmakum"},{"a":"سُبَاتًۭا","en":"(for) rest","id":"(for) rest","t":"subātan"}]},{"n":10,"key":"78:10","arabic":"وَجَعَلْنَا ٱلَّيْلَ لِبَاسًا","page":582,"juz":30,"en":"And made the night as clothing.","id":"dan Kami menjadikan malam sebagai pakaian,","latinEn":"WajaAAalna allayla libasa","latinId":"Wa ja‘alnal-laila libāsā(n).","words":[{"a":"وَجَعَلْنَا","en":"And We made","id":"And We made","t":"wajaʿalnā"},{"a":"ٱلَّيْلَ","en":"the night","id":"the night","t":"al-layla"},{"a":"لِبَاسًۭا","en":"(as) covering","id":"(as) covering","t":"libāsan"}]},{"n":11,"key":"78:11","arabic":"وَجَعَلْنَا ٱلنَّهَارَ مَعَاشًا","page":582,"juz":30,"en":"And made the day for livelihood.","id":"dan Kami menjadikan siang untuk mencari penghidupan,","latinEn":"WajaAAalna annaharamaAAasha","latinId":"Wa ja‘alnan-nahāra ma‘āsyā(n).","words":[{"a":"وَجَعَلْنَا","en":"And We made","id":"And We made","t":"wajaʿalnā"},{"a":"ٱلنَّهَارَ","en":"the day","id":"the day","t":"l-nahāra"},{"a":"مَعَاشًۭا","en":"(for) livelihood","id":"(for) livelihood","t":"maʿāshan"}]},{"n":12,"key":"78:12","arabic":"وَبَنَيْنَا فَوْقَكُمْ سَبْعًا شِدَادًا","page":582,"juz":30,"en":"And constructed above you seven strong [heavens].","id":"dan Kami membangun di atas kamu tujuh (lapis langit) yang kokoh,","latinEn":"Wabanayna fawqakum sabAAan shidada","latinId":"Wa banainā fauqakum sab‘an syidādā(n).","words":[{"a":"وَبَنَيْنَا","en":"And We constructed","id":"And We constructed","t":"wabanaynā"},{"a":"فَوْقَكُمْ","en":"over you","id":"over you","t":"fawqakum"},{"a":"سَبْعًۭا","en":"seven","id":"seven","t":"sabʿan"},{"a":"شِدَادًۭا","en":"strong","id":"strong","t":"shidādan"}]},{"n":13,"key":"78:13","arabic":"وَجَعَلْنَا سِرَاجًا وَهَّاجًا","page":582,"juz":30,"en":"And made [therein] a burning lamp","id":"dan Kami menjadikan pelita yang terang-benderang (matahari),","latinEn":"WajaAAalna sirajan wahhaja","latinId":"Wa ja‘alnā sirājaw wahhājā(n).","words":[{"a":"وَجَعَلْنَا","en":"And We placed","id":"And We placed","t":"wajaʿalnā"},{"a":"سِرَاجًۭا","en":"a lamp","id":"a lamp","t":"sirājan"},{"a":"وَهَّاجًۭا","en":"burning","id":"burning","t":"wahhājan"}]},{"n":14,"key":"78:14","arabic":"وَأَنزَلْنَا مِنَ ٱلْمُعْصِرَٰتِ مَآءً ثَجَّاجًا","page":582,"juz":30,"en":"And sent down, from the rain clouds, pouring water.","id":"dan Kami turunkan dari awan, air hujan yang tercurah dengan lebatnya,","latinEn":"Waanzalna mina almuAAsiratimaan thajjaja","latinId":"Wa anzalnā minal-mu‘ṣirāti mā'an ṡajjājā(n).","words":[{"a":"وَأَنزَلْنَا","en":"And We sent down","id":"And We sent down","t":"wa-anzalnā"},{"a":"مِنَ","en":"from","id":"from","t":"mina"},{"a":"ٱلْمُعْصِرَٰتِ","en":"the rain clouds","id":"the rain clouds","t":"l-muʿ'ṣirāti"},{"a":"مَآءًۭ","en":"water","id":"water","t":"māan"},{"a":"ثَجَّاجًۭا","en":"pouring abundantly","id":"pouring abundantly","t":"thajjājan"}]},{"n":15,"key":"78:15","arabic":"لِّنُخْرِجَ بِهِۦ حَبًّا وَنَبَاتًا","page":582,"juz":30,"en":"That We may bring forth thereby grain and vegetation.","id":"untuk Kami tumbuhkan dengan air itu biji-bijian dan tanam-tanaman,","latinEn":"Linukhrija bihi habban wanabata","latinId":"Linukhrija bihī ḥabbaw wa nabātā(n).","words":[{"a":"لِّنُخْرِجَ","en":"That We may bring forth","id":"That We may bring forth","t":"linukh'rija"},{"a":"بِهِۦ","en":"thereby","id":"thereby","t":"bihi"},{"a":"حَبًّۭا","en":"grain","id":"grain","t":"ḥabban"},{"a":"وَنَبَاتًۭا","en":"and vegetation","id":"and vegetation","t":"wanabātan"}]},{"n":16,"key":"78:16","arabic":"وَجَنَّـٰتٍ أَلْفَافًا","page":582,"juz":30,"en":"And gardens of entwined growth.","id":"dan kebun-kebun yang rindang.","latinEn":"Wajannatin alfafa","latinId":"Wa jannātin alfāfā(n).","words":[{"a":"وَجَنَّـٰتٍ","en":"And gardens","id":"And gardens","t":"wajannātin"},{"a":"أَلْفَافًا","en":"(of) thick foliage","id":"(of) thick foliage","t":"alfāfan"}]},{"n":17,"key":"78:17","arabic":"إِنَّ يَوْمَ ٱلْفَصْلِ كَانَ مِيقَـٰتًا","page":582,"juz":30,"en":"Indeed, the Day of Judgement is an appointed time -","id":"Sungguh, hari keputusan adalah suatu waktu yang telah ditetapkan,","latinEn":"Inna yawma alfasli kana meeqata","latinId":"Inna yaumal-faṣli kāna mīqātā(n).","words":[{"a":"إِنَّ","en":"Indeed","id":"Indeed","t":"inna"},{"a":"يَوْمَ","en":"(the) Day","id":"(the) Day","t":"yawma"},{"a":"ٱلْفَصْلِ","en":"(of) the Judgment","id":"(of) the Judgment","t":"l-faṣli"},{"a":"كَانَ","en":"is","id":"is","t":"kāna"},{"a":"مِيقَـٰتًۭا","en":"an appointed time","id":"an appointed time","t":"mīqātan"}]},{"n":18,"key":"78:18","arabic":"يَوْمَ يُنفَخُ فِى ٱلصُّورِ فَتَأْتُونَ أَفْوَاجًا","page":582,"juz":30,"en":"The Day the Horn is blown and you will come forth in multitudes","id":"(yaitu) pada hari (ketika) sangkakala ditiup, lalu kamu datang berbondong-bondong,","latinEn":"Yawma yunfakhu fee assoorifata/toona afwaja","latinId":"Yauma yunfakhu fiṣ-ṣūri fa ta'tūna afwājā(n).","words":[{"a":"يَوْمَ","en":"(The) Day","id":"(The) Day","t":"yawma"},{"a":"يُنفَخُ","en":"(in which) shall be blown","id":"(in which) shall be blown","t":"yunfakhu"},{"a":"فِى","en":"in","id":"in","t":"fī"},{"a":"ٱلصُّورِ","en":"the trumpet","id":"the trumpet","t":"l-ṣūri"},{"a":"فَتَأْتُونَ","en":"and you will come forth","id":"and you will come forth","t":"fatatūna"},{"a":"أَفْوَاجًۭا","en":"(in) crowds","id":"(in) crowds","t":"afwājan"}]},{"n":19,"key":"78:19","arabic":"وَفُتِحَتِ ٱلسَّمَآءُ فَكَانَتْ أَبْوَٰبًا","page":582,"juz":30,"en":"And the heaven is opened and will become gateways.","id":"dan langit pun dibukalah, maka terdapatlah beberapa pintu,","latinEn":"Wafutihati assamao fakanatabwaba","latinId":"Wa futiḥatis-samā'u fa kānat abwābā(n).","words":[{"a":"وَفُتِحَتِ","en":"And is opened","id":"And is opened","t":"wafutiḥati"},{"a":"ٱلسَّمَآءُ","en":"the heaven","id":"the heaven","t":"l-samāu"},{"a":"فَكَانَتْ","en":"and becomes","id":"and becomes","t":"fakānat"},{"a":"أَبْوَٰبًۭا","en":"gateways","id":"gateways","t":"abwāban"}]},{"n":20,"key":"78:20","arabic":"وَسُيِّرَتِ ٱلْجِبَالُ فَكَانَتْ سَرَابًا","page":582,"juz":30,"en":"And the mountains are removed and will be [but] a mirage.","id":"dan gunung-gunungpun dijalankan sehingga menjadi fatamorgana.","latinEn":"Wasuyyirati aljibalu fakanatsaraba","latinId":"Wa suyyiratil-jibālu fa kānat sarābā(n).","words":[{"a":"وَسُيِّرَتِ","en":"And are moved","id":"And are moved","t":"wasuyyirati"},{"a":"ٱلْجِبَالُ","en":"the mountains","id":"the mountains","t":"l-jibālu"},{"a":"فَكَانَتْ","en":"and become","id":"and become","t":"fakānat"},{"a":"سَرَابًا","en":"a mirage","id":"a mirage","t":"sarāban"}]},{"n":21,"key":"78:21","arabic":"إِنَّ جَهَنَّمَ كَانَتْ مِرْصَادًا","page":582,"juz":30,"en":"Indeed, Hell has been lying in wait","id":"Sungguh, (neraka) Jahanam itu (sebagai) tempat mengintai (bagi penjaga yang mengawasi isi neraka),","latinEn":"Inna jahannama kanat mirsada","latinId":"Inna jahannama kānat mirṣādā(n).","words":[{"a":"إِنَّ","en":"Indeed","id":"Indeed","t":"inna"},{"a":"جَهَنَّمَ","en":"Hell","id":"Hell","t":"jahannama"},{"a":"كَانَتْ","en":"is","id":"is","t":"kānat"},{"a":"مِرْصَادًۭا","en":"lying in wait","id":"lying in wait","t":"mir'ṣādan"}]},{"n":22,"key":"78:22","arabic":"لِّلطَّـٰغِينَ مَـَٔابًا","page":582,"juz":30,"en":"For the transgressors, a place of return,","id":"menjadi tempat kembali bagi orang-orang yang melampaui batas.","latinEn":"Littagheena maaba","latinId":"Liṭ-ṭāgīna ma'ābā(n).","words":[{"a":"لِّلطَّـٰغِينَ","en":"For the transgressors","id":"For the transgressors","t":"lilṭṭāghīna"},{"a":"مَـَٔابًۭا","en":"a place of return","id":"a place of return","t":"maāban"}]},{"n":23,"key":"78:23","arabic":"لَّـٰبِثِينَ فِيهَآ أَحْقَابًا","page":582,"juz":30,"en":"In which they will remain for ages [unending].","id":"Mereka tinggal di sana dalam masa yang lama,","latinEn":"Labitheena feeha ahqaba","latinId":"Lābiṡīna fīhā aḥqābā(n).","words":[{"a":"لَّـٰبِثِينَ","en":"(They will) be remaining","id":"(They will) be remaining","t":"lābithīna"},{"a":"فِيهَآ","en":"therein","id":"therein","t":"fīhā"},{"a":"أَحْقَابًۭا","en":"(for) ages","id":"(for) ages","t":"aḥqāban"}]},{"n":24,"key":"78:24","arabic":"لَّا يَذُوقُونَ فِيهَا بَرْدًا وَلَا شَرَابًا","page":582,"juz":30,"en":"They will not taste therein [any] coolness or drink.","id":"mereka tidak merasakan kesejukan di dalamnya dan tidak (pula mendapat) minuman,","latinEn":"La yathooqoona feehabardan wala sharaba","latinId":"Lā yażūqūna fīhā bardaw wa lā syarābā(n).","words":[{"a":"لَّا","en":"Not","id":"Not","t":"lā"},{"a":"يَذُوقُونَ","en":"they will taste","id":"they will taste","t":"yadhūqūna"},{"a":"فِيهَا","en":"therein","id":"therein","t":"fīhā"},{"a":"بَرْدًۭا","en":"coolness","id":"coolness","t":"bardan"},{"a":"وَلَا","en":"and not","id":"and not","t":"walā"},{"a":"شَرَابًا","en":"any drink","id":"any drink","t":"sharāban"}]},{"n":25,"key":"78:25","arabic":"إِلَّا حَمِيمًا وَغَسَّاقًا","page":582,"juz":30,"en":"Except scalding water and [foul] purulence -","id":"selain air yang mendidih dan nanah,","latinEn":"Illa hameeman waghassaqa","latinId":"Illā ḥamīmaw wa gassāqā(n).","words":[{"a":"إِلَّا","en":"Except","id":"Except","t":"illā"},{"a":"حَمِيمًۭا","en":"scalding water","id":"scalding water","t":"ḥamīman"},{"a":"وَغَسَّاقًۭا","en":"and purulence","id":"and purulence","t":"waghassāqan"}]},{"n":26,"key":"78:26","arabic":"جَزَآءً وِفَاقًا","page":582,"juz":30,"en":"An appropriate recompense.","id":"sebagai pembalasan yang setimpal.","latinEn":"Jazaan wifaqa","latinId":"Jazā'aw wifāqā(n).","words":[{"a":"جَزَآءًۭ","en":"A recompense","id":"A recompense","t":"jazāan"},{"a":"وِفَاقًا","en":"appropriate","id":"appropriate","t":"wifāqan"}]},{"n":27,"key":"78:27","arabic":"إِنَّهُمْ كَانُوا۟ لَا يَرْجُونَ حِسَابًا","page":582,"juz":30,"en":"Indeed, they were not expecting an account","id":"Sesungguhnya dahulu mereka tidak pernah mengharapkan perhitungan,","latinEn":"Innahum kanoo la yarjoona hisaba","latinId":"Innahum kānū lā yarjūna ḥisābā(n).","words":[{"a":"إِنَّهُمْ","en":"Indeed, they","id":"Indeed, they","t":"innahum"},{"a":"كَانُوا۟","en":"were","id":"were","t":"kānū"},{"a":"لَا","en":"not","id":"not","t":"lā"},{"a":"يَرْجُونَ","en":"expecting","id":"expecting","t":"yarjūna"},{"a":"حِسَابًۭا","en":"an account","id":"an account","t":"ḥisāban"}]},{"n":28,"key":"78:28","arabic":"وَكَذَّبُوا۟ بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا كِذَّابًا","page":582,"juz":30,"en":"And denied Our verses with [emphatic] denial.","id":"dan mereka benar-benar mendustakan ayat-ayat Kami.","latinEn":"Wakaththaboo bi-ayatinakiththaba","latinId":"Wa każżabū bi'āyātinā kiżżābā(n).","words":[{"a":"وَكَذَّبُوا۟","en":"And they denied","id":"And they denied","t":"wakadhabū"},{"a":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا","en":"Our Signs","id":"Our Signs","t":"biāyātinā"},{"a":"كِذَّابًۭا","en":"(with) denial","id":"(with) denial","t":"kidhāban"}]},{"n":29,"key":"78:29","arabic":"وَكُلَّ شَىْءٍ أَحْصَيْنَـٰهُ كِتَـٰبًا","page":582,"juz":30,"en":"But all things We have enumerated in writing.","id":"Dan segala sesuatu telah Kami catat dalam suatu Kitab (buku catatan amalan manusia).","latinEn":"Wakulla shay-in ahsaynahu kitaba","latinId":"Wa kulla syai'in aḥṣaināhu kitābā(n).","words":[{"a":"وَكُلَّ","en":"And every","id":"And every","t":"wakulla"},{"a":"شَىْءٍ","en":"thing","id":"thing","t":"shayin"},{"a":"أَحْصَيْنَـٰهُ","en":"We have enumerated it","id":"We have enumerated it","t":"aḥṣaynāhu"},{"a":"كِتَـٰبًۭا","en":"(in) a Book","id":"(in) a Book","t":"kitāban"}]},{"n":30,"key":"78:30","arabic":"فَذُوقُوا۟ فَلَن نَّزِيدَكُمْ إِلَّا عَذَابًا","page":582,"juz":30,"en":"\"So taste [the penalty], and never will We increase you except in torment.\"","id":"Maka karena itu rasakanlah! Maka tidak ada yang akan Kami tambahkan kepadamu selain azab.","latinEn":"Fathooqoo falan nazeedakum illaAAathaba","latinId":"Fa żūqū falan nazīdakum illā ‘ażābā(n)","words":[{"a":"فَذُوقُوا۟","en":"So taste","id":"So taste","t":"fadhūqū"},{"a":"فَلَن","en":"and never","id":"and never","t":"falan"},{"a":"نَّزِيدَكُمْ","en":"We will increase you","id":"We will increase you","t":"nazīdakum"},{"a":"إِلَّا","en":"except","id":"except","t":"illā"},{"a":"عَذَابًا","en":"(in) punishment","id":"(in) punishment","t":"ʿadhāban"}]},{"n":31,"key":"78:31","arabic":"إِنَّ لِلْمُتَّقِينَ مَفَازًا","page":583,"juz":30,"en":"Indeed, for the righteous is attainment -","id":"Sungguh, orang-orang yang bertakwa mendapat kemenangan,","latinEn":"Inna lilmuttaqeena mafaza","latinId":"Inna lil-muttaqīna mafāzā(n).","words":[{"a":"إِنَّ","en":"Indeed","id":"Indeed","t":"inna"},{"a":"لِلْمُتَّقِينَ","en":"for the righteous","id":"for the righteous","t":"lil'muttaqīna"},{"a":"مَفَازًا","en":"(is) success","id":"(is) success","t":"mafāzan"}]},{"n":32,"key":"78:32","arabic":"حَدَآئِقَ وَأَعْنَـٰبًا","page":583,"juz":30,"en":"Gardens and grapevines.","id":"(yaitu) kebun-kebun dan buah anggur,","latinEn":"Hada-iqa waaAAnaba","latinId":"Ḥadā'iqa wa a‘nābā(n).","words":[{"a":"حَدَآئِقَ","en":"Gardens","id":"Gardens","t":"ḥadāiqa"},{"a":"وَأَعْنَـٰبًۭا","en":"and grapevines","id":"and grapevines","t":"wa-aʿnāban"}]},{"n":33,"key":"78:33","arabic":"وَكَوَاعِبَ أَتْرَابًا","page":583,"juz":30,"en":"And full-breasted [companions] of equal age.","id":"dan gadis-gadis belia yang sebaya,","latinEn":"WakawaAAiba atraba","latinId":"Wa kawā‘iba atrābā(n).","words":[{"a":"وَكَوَاعِبَ","en":"And splendid companions","id":"And splendid companions","t":"wakawāʿiba"},{"a":"أَتْرَابًۭا","en":"well-matched","id":"well-matched","t":"atrāban"}]},{"n":34,"key":"78:34","arabic":"وَكَأْسًا دِهَاقًا","page":583,"juz":30,"en":"And a full cup.","id":"dan gelas-gelas yang penuh (berisi minuman).","latinEn":"Waka/san dihaqa","latinId":"Wa ka'san dihāqā(n).","words":[{"a":"وَكَأْسًۭا","en":"And a cup","id":"And a cup","t":"wakasan"},{"a":"دِهَاقًۭا","en":"full","id":"full","t":"dihāqan"}]},{"n":35,"key":"78:35","arabic":"لَّا يَسْمَعُونَ فِيهَا لَغْوًا وَلَا كِذَّٰبًا","page":583,"juz":30,"en":"No ill speech will they hear therein or any falsehood -","id":"Di sana mereka tidak mendengar percakapan yang sia-sia maupun (perkataan dusta).","latinEn":"La yasmaAAoona feeha laghwanwala kiththaba","latinId":"Lā yasma‘ūna fīhā lagwaw wa lā kiżżābā(n).","words":[{"a":"لَّا","en":"Not","id":"Not","t":"lā"},{"a":"يَسْمَعُونَ","en":"they will hear","id":"they will hear","t":"yasmaʿūna"},{"a":"فِيهَا","en":"therein","id":"therein","t":"fīhā"},{"a":"لَغْوًۭا","en":"any vain talk","id":"any vain talk","t":"laghwan"},{"a":"وَلَا","en":"and not","id":"and not","t":"walā"},{"a":"كِذَّٰبًۭا","en":"any falsehood","id":"any falsehood","t":"kidhāban"}]},{"n":36,"key":"78:36","arabic":"جَزَآءً مِّن رَّبِّكَ عَطَآءً حِسَابًا","page":583,"juz":30,"en":"[As] reward from your Lord, [a generous] gift [made due by] account,","id":"Sebagai balasan dan pemberian yang cukup banyak dari Tuhanmu,","latinEn":"Jazaan min rabbika AAataan hisaba","latinId":"Jazā'am mir rabbika ‘aṭā'an ḥisābā(n).","words":[{"a":"جَزَآءًۭ","en":"(As) a reward","id":"(As) a reward","t":"jazāan"},{"a":"مِّن","en":"from","id":"from","t":"min"},{"a":"رَّبِّكَ","en":"your Lord","id":"your Lord","t":"rabbika"},{"a":"عَطَآءً","en":"a gift","id":"a gift","t":"ʿaṭāan"},{"a":"حِسَابًۭا","en":"(according to) account","id":"(according to) account","t":"ḥisāban"}]},{"n":37,"key":"78:37","arabic":"رَّبِّ ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضِ وَمَا بَيْنَهُمَا ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنِ ۖ لَا يَمْلِكُونَ مِنْهُ خِطَابًا","page":583,"juz":30,"en":"[From] the Lord of the heavens and the earth and whatever is between them, the Most Merciful. They possess not from Him [authority for] speech.","id":"Tuhan (yang memelihara) langit dan bumi serta apa yang ada di antara keduanya; Yang Maha Pengasih, mereka tidak mampu berbicara dengan Dia.","latinEn":"Rabbi assamawati wal-ardiwama baynahuma arrahmani layamlikoona minhu khitaba","latinId":"Rabbis-samāwāti wal-arḍi wa mā bainahumar-raḥmāni lā yamlikūna minhu khiṭābā(n).","words":[{"a":"رَّبِّ","en":"Lord","id":"Lord","t":"rabbi"},{"a":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","en":"(of) the heavens","id":"(of) the heavens","t":"l-samāwāti"},{"a":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ","en":"and the earth","id":"and the earth","t":"wal-arḍi"},{"a":"وَمَا","en":"and whatever","id":"and whatever","t":"wamā"},{"a":"بَيْنَهُمَا","en":"(is) between both of them","id":"(is) between both of them","t":"baynahumā"},{"a":"ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنِ ۖ","en":"the Most Gracious","id":"the Most Gracious","t":"l-raḥmāni"},{"a":"لَا","en":"not","id":"not","t":"lā"},{"a":"يَمْلِكُونَ","en":"they have power","id":"they have power","t":"yamlikūna"},{"a":"مِنْهُ","en":"from Him","id":"from Him","t":"min'hu"},{"a":"خِطَابًۭا","en":"(to) address","id":"(to) address","t":"khiṭāban"}]},{"n":38,"key":"78:38","arabic":"يَوْمَ يَقُومُ ٱلرُّوحُ وَٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ صَفًّا ۖ لَّا يَتَكَلَّمُونَ إِلَّا مَنْ أَذِنَ لَهُ ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنُ وَقَالَ صَوَابًا","page":583,"juz":30,"en":"The Day that the Spirit [i.e., Gabriel] and the angels will stand in rows, they will not speak except for one whom the Most Merciful permits, and he will say what is correct.","id":"Pada hari, ketika rūḥ dan para malaikat berdiri bersaf-saf, mereka tidak berkata-kata, kecuali siapa yang telah diberi izin kepadanya oleh Tuhan Yang Maha Pengasih dan dia hanya mengatakan yang benar.","latinEn":"Yawma yaqoomu arroohu walmala-ikatusaffan la yatakallamoona illa man athinalahu arrahmanu waqala sawaba","latinId":"Yauma yaqūmur-rūḥu wal-malā'ikatu ṣaffā(n), lā yatakallamūna illā man ażina lahur-raḥmānu wa qāla ṣawābā(n).","words":[{"a":"يَوْمَ","en":"(The) Day","id":"(The) Day","t":"yawma"},{"a":"يَقُومُ","en":"will stand","id":"will stand","t":"yaqūmu"},{"a":"ٱلرُّوحُ","en":"the Spirit","id":"the Spirit","t":"l-rūḥu"},{"a":"وَٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ","en":"and the Angels","id":"and the Angels","t":"wal-malāikatu"},{"a":"صَفًّۭا ۖ","en":"(in) rows","id":"(in) rows","t":"ṣaffan"},{"a":"لَّا","en":"not","id":"not","t":"lā"},{"a":"يَتَكَلَّمُونَ","en":"they will speak","id":"they will speak","t":"yatakallamūna"},{"a":"إِلَّا","en":"except","id":"except","t":"illā"},{"a":"مَنْ","en":"(one) who","id":"(one) who","t":"man"},{"a":"أَذِنَ","en":"permits","id":"permits","t":"adhina"},{"a":"لَهُ","en":"[for] him","id":"[for] him","t":"lahu"},{"a":"ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنُ","en":"the Most Gracious","id":"the Most Gracious","t":"l-raḥmānu"},{"a":"وَقَالَ","en":"and he (will) say","id":"and he (will) say","t":"waqāla"},{"a":"صَوَابًۭا","en":"(what is) correct","id":"(what is) correct","t":"ṣawāban"}]},{"n":39,"key":"78:39","arabic":"ذَٰلِكَ ٱلْيَوْمُ ٱلْحَقُّ ۖ فَمَن شَآءَ ٱتَّخَذَ إِلَىٰ رَبِّهِۦ مَـَٔابًا","page":583,"juz":30,"en":"That is the True [i.e., certain] Day; so he who wills may take to his Lord a [way of] return.","id":"Itulah hari yang pasti terjadi. Maka barangsiapa menghendaki, niscaya dia menempuh jalan kembali kepada Tuhannya.","latinEn":"Thalika alyawmu alhaqqu famanshaa ittakhatha ila rabbihi maaba","latinId":"Żālikal-yaumul-ḥaqq(u), faman syā'attakhaża ilā rabbihī ma'ābā(n).","words":[{"a":"ذَٰلِكَ","en":"That","id":"That","t":"dhālika"},{"a":"ٱلْيَوْمُ","en":"(is) the Day","id":"(is) the Day","t":"l-yawmu"},{"a":"ٱلْحَقُّ ۖ","en":"the True","id":"the True","t":"l-ḥaqu"},{"a":"فَمَن","en":"So whoever","id":"So whoever","t":"faman"},{"a":"شَآءَ","en":"wills","id":"wills","t":"shāa"},{"a":"ٱتَّخَذَ","en":"let him take","id":"let him take","t":"ittakhadha"},{"a":"إِلَىٰ","en":"towards","id":"towards","t":"ilā"},{"a":"رَبِّهِۦ","en":"his Lord","id":"his Lord","t":"rabbihi"},{"a":"مَـَٔابًا","en":"a return","id":"a return","t":"maāban"}]},{"n":40,"key":"78:40","arabic":"إِنَّآ أَنذَرْنَـٰكُمْ عَذَابًا قَرِيبًا يَوْمَ يَنظُرُ ٱلْمَرْءُ مَا قَدَّمَتْ يَدَاهُ وَيَقُولُ ٱلْكَافِرُ يَـٰلَيْتَنِى كُنتُ تُرَٰبًۢا","page":583,"juz":30,"en":"Indeed, We have warned you of an impending punishment on the Day when a man will observe what his hands have put forth and the disbeliever will say, \"Oh, I wish that I were dust!\"","id":"Sesungguhnya Kami telah memperingatkan kepadamu (orang kafir) azab yang dekat, pada hari manusia melihat apa yang telah diperbuat oleh kedua tangannya; dan orang kafir berkata, \"Alangkah baiknya seandainya dahulu aku jadi tanah.\"","latinEn":"Inna antharnakum AAathabanqareeban yawma yanthuru almaro ma qaddamatyadahu wayaqoolu alkafiru ya laytanee kuntuturaba","latinId":"Innā anżarnākum ‘ażāban qarībā(n), yauma yanẓurul-mar'u mā qaddamat yadāhu wa yaqūlul-kāfiru yā laitanī kuntu turābā(n).","words":[{"a":"إِنَّآ","en":"Indeed We","id":"Indeed We","t":"innā"},{"a":"أَنذَرْنَـٰكُمْ","en":"[We] have warned you","id":"[We] have warned you","t":"andharnākum"},{"a":"عَذَابًۭا","en":"(of) a punishment","id":"(of) a punishment","t":"ʿadhāban"},{"a":"قَرِيبًۭا","en":"near","id":"near","t":"qarīban"},{"a":"يَوْمَ","en":"(the) Day","id":"(the) Day","t":"yawma"},{"a":"يَنظُرُ","en":"will see","id":"will see","t":"yanẓuru"},{"a":"ٱلْمَرْءُ","en":"the man","id":"the man","t":"l-maru"},{"a":"مَا","en":"what","id":"what","t":"mā"},{"a":"قَدَّمَتْ","en":"have sent forth","id":"have sent forth","t":"qaddamat"},{"a":"يَدَاهُ","en":"his hands","id":"his hands","t":"yadāhu"},{"a":"وَيَقُولُ","en":"and will say","id":"and will say","t":"wayaqūlu"},{"a":"ٱلْكَافِرُ","en":"the disbeliever","id":"the disbeliever","t":"l-kāfiru"},{"a":"يَـٰلَيْتَنِى","en":"O I wish","id":"O I wish","t":"yālaytanī"},{"a":"كُنتُ","en":"I were","id":"I were","t":"kuntu"},{"a":"تُرَٰبًۢا","en":"dust","id":"dust","t":"turāban"}]}]}